5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"We should ensure that any program we select is financially sustainable in the long term, not just for the initial setup.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Financials are one thing, but we need evidence of actual patient impact. We can't just add another failed initiative to the pile.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. I'm also worried about the people implementing it. We must ensure the staff aren't already stretched too thin to handle more.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the logistics! If we add something new, will the rooms and the booking system actually handle the extra traffic without crashing?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"You all make such wonderful points. I just hope we ensure that everyone involved truly agrees to the plan, so it doesn't crumble later.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, that's true. But if the running costs aren't covered after the first year, the rooms won't matter. We need to see the ledger.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ledger only tells us what we spent, not what we achieved. I want to see the data from previous trials.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, data is important, but if the nursing staff are already relying on agency cover, a ""successful"" trial might just be hiding burnout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! If the parking is full and the booking screens are jammed, it doesn't matter how good the trial was. It'll just be a mess.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is so easy to forget the human side of agreements. I wonder if our outside partners are as committed as we think they are.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I think we should look into the actual allocation and the tariffs to see if there is any revenue potential to offset costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking at the readmission figures and the nursing round completions. I want to see if anything actually worked.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll focus on the staffing reviews. I want to know who is actually available to work these new rosters without breaking.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going to check the booking system and the rooms and parking. I need to know if we have the physical space to breathe!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the board minutes and the data agreements. I want to see where the promises were made and if they were signed.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
